0397906,"text":"それとも、物語によく出てくる、「人に知られたらまずい秘密を隠してるから、立ち入り禁止にされた謎の部屋」とかか？","nextNodeIds":[706760104]},{"nodeId":706760104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2510040514,"text":"立ち入り禁止なら、鍵をかけてるはず。","nextNodeIds":[706760105]},{"nodeId":706760105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":86550354,"text":"それもそうだな。さっきは普通に入れたし、ロックが壊れたとかでもなさそうだよな…","nextNodeIds":[706760106]},{"nodeId":706760106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3982295714,"text":"あれ？待てよ。このドア、オイラたちがさっき入った時に通ったやつと違うぞ…！うわぁー！ここって本当にまだ図書館か…？","nextNodeIds":[706760107,706760109]},{"nodeId":706760107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1521037546,"text":"シードル湖の底だったりして。","nextNodeIds":[706760108]},{"nodeId":706760108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3375271706,"text":"そんな構造になってたのか、すごいぜ…って、違ーう！どう考えてもあり得ないだろ！","nextNodeIds":[706760111]},{"nodeId":706760111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1047150802,"text":"うぅ…リサさんがお休みじゃなきゃ聞けたのに。まあ、せっかく来たわけだし、別に危ない要素もなさそうだから、周りを見て回ろうぜ？","nextNodeIds":[706760112]},{"nodeId":706760112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":181253730,"text":"新しい場所に来たら、まずは思いっきり自由に探索すること！これがいいガイドになるための秘訣だぞ。フフン。","nextNodeIds":[706760113]},{"nodeId":706760113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1362856514,"text":"見ろよ、狼のぬいぐるみだ！すっごく可愛いぞ！","nextNodeIds":[706760114]},{"nodeId":706760114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1547816234,"text":"もふもふで、触り心地もよさそうだな！でも、一体誰がここに置いたんだ…","nextNodeIds":[706760115,706760117]},{"nodeId":706760115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3916181546,"text":"このぬいぐるみこそ部屋の主なのかも。","nextNodeIds":[706760116]},{"nodeId":706760116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":619907362,"text":"「恐れを知らぬ旅人よ。よくも我が城に侵入したな。全員食べてやる！ガオー！」","nextNodeIds":[706760120]},{"nodeId":706760120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":512572882,"text":"…ま、ほっとこうぜ。かなり広そうだから、他のところも見てみよう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706760117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3783864666,"text":"謎の部屋の門番かも。","nextNodeIds":[706760118]},{"nodeId":706760118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3583793722,"text":"門番なのに部屋の中のソファーでのんびり寝てていいのかよ！","nextNodeIds":[706760119]},{"nodeId":706760119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":970789410,"text":"「すぴー、すぴー…危険がないということはつまり危険がないってことだ…すぴー…」","nextNodeIds":[706760120]},{"nodeId":706760109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3871690962,"text":"もしかしたらもう別の世界かも…","nextNodeIds":[706760110]},{"nodeId":706760110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2351723754,"text":"別の世界ってどの世界だよ！","nextNodeIds":[706760111]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7067601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[156,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FAIL_DUNGEON","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[48000,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","1218"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNLOCK_POINT"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1004","2"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNLOCK_POINT"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["48000","248000001"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBB